This file states the default legal position rather than choosing a new one:
absent an explicit licence, all rights are reserved automatically. It is
included so the terms are unambiguous to anyone who finds the repository.

If the intention is to release this project under an open-source licence
(MIT, Apache-2.0, AGPL-3.0 or similar), replace this file with the chosen
licence text. That is a commercial decision for the owner, not a technical
one, and it is deliberately left unmade here.
